### Get all agents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agents


### Get agent by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agents/1


### Create new agent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Research Bot",
  "role": "Research",
  "description": "Finds and summarizes useful information"
}


### Update agent
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/agents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated AI Assistant",
  "role": "Support",
  "description": "Updated description for the assistant agent"
}


### Delete agent
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/agents/2